{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/6fa2feb8d26f54cf92d19c733559c4ba88501dbfb55c26f1853c8610df0c3c62c51fa8cd6336409f636c5a0726ac00ba10e9829731568f4b61061171bc875be9","height":1347813378,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/nHSFNy0nI7FKXFdgMuoxtSNcDVz5SXoufcK3kc8OO4A76AtTwTGi1BBRWVHTDRdmP2ByiTgDdAHNiGjU9XFDuo5dW-WoNkgqLr5yaw","width":1459618391},"name":"Kate Lockhart","title":"Google Content Strategist"},"document_id":6368385317994496,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/a0fcd86b14754558c710dcba562dbabb744db222eae44b14f8ec0b166e66afa34949ac131f71361a23e11219788a17b8ca9766f4b30edd26c22ef995cd3aebf6","height":1128857602,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/nRNlwvmeu2PUdKdHBbYUPwvG3rSrxRER56MZRoix6DodFrRfS2iIQ-MQYNo_zREO5K76eyT3Q4dzTGEhRGAY24axyR9n1JSrcTeajg","width":1459618391},"name":"Alan Mclean","title":"Google Designer"},"document_id":5868417478033408,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/d134553f42a4a26a898a6431fb862746cc51ca867f71d734d41b00ce0f826ca82626ae9e46288dcedc56b1de466ac9173b701e582447101b9840d786920c2bff","height":1128857602,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/x5Vhf2B3ZCvW9u7zO6vd1TnSv3yWMdolXORznFgi0aU_H9wUyBtr1c9DnzFYjfo8vgLthiucUEqRG06DU6_tF66j_YPdWQeMEj1vYQ","width":1459618391},"name":"Maggie Stanphill","title":"Google UX Director"},"document_id":6497922043346944,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>在思考数字健康时，Material 致力于培育<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/digital-wellbeing-design-systems\">人们的基本需求</a>。但在实际操作层面，对整体健康以及与数字产品保持健康关系的需求，是如何融入 Material Design 系统的呢？</p>\n<p>为了回答这个问题，Material 与 Google 跨部门的数字健康团队合作，制定了一套 UX 原则，为系统实现和新设计提供依据。</p>\n<p>数字健康工具包（Digital Wellbeing Toolkit）包含四条面向健康的 UX 原则，并配有指南、用例、发人深省的思考引子，以及一套可将这些概念付诸实践的工作坊工具包。该工具包将于今天在<a href=\"https://www.internationaldesignconference.com/\">国际设计大会</a>上预览，并即将公开发布。以下是新原则与新指南的抢先一览，以及该项目背后的研究。</p>\n<h2>通过默认设置赋能</h2>\n<p>要人们在即时满足与长期健康之间选择后者，并不容易。&ldquo;赋能&rdquo;原则承认，默认设置在扭转天平、促成增进健康的决策方面可以发挥根本性作用。事实证明，默认设置<a href=\"https://www.sas.upenn.edu/~baron/475/choice.architecture.pdf\">能够</a>有效（而且往往毫不费力地）促使人们在财务（默认类型：可退出式 401k 储蓄计划）和公共卫生（默认类型：可退出式器官捐赠登记）方面做出积极选择。设计健康的默认设置，为积极影响用户健康提供了机会。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>一个支持性的产品默认设置示例，可以在 YouTube 的<a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9012950?co=GENIE.Platform%3DAndroid&amp;hl=en\">停用声音和通知</a>选项中看到：该设置默认在晚上 10 点至早上 8 点之间促进休息。用户固然可以随时关闭该设置，或根据自己的需要调整时间，但默认设置以用户健康为出发点，而不是需要用户自行完成的额外步骤。</p>\n<h2>提升对行为与目标的觉察</h2>\n<p>能引发自我反思的信息和机会，有助于人们更清楚地意识到自己是如何度过时间的。研究人员已经证明，让人们对设备使用等活动保持自我觉察，能有效唤起人们对自身目标的意识，<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19916637/\">尤其是睡眠、锻炼和营养</a>。当用户定期收到关于自身活动的反馈时，他们就更有能力轻松纠正可能偏离目标的行为。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>要为健康而设计，引入使用数据可以促使人们反思自己的活动和目标。常见方法包括仪表盘、数据可视化，以及 UI 中针对特定行为的洞见。</p>\n<h2>提供透明的设置</h2>\n<p>根据 Google 委托开展的一项 2019 年研究，每 3 个人中就有 1 个人已经或曾尝试改变自己对科技的使用，以应对他们遭遇的不良影响。在针对这种经历采取行动的人中，超过 80% 认为这样做有帮助。这一洞见给了我们另一个理由，让控件易于获取、易于发现，这样当人们想要改变自己的习惯或体验时，就能尽可能轻松。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://material.io/components/selection-controls#switches\">开/关开关</a>是为人们提供更细粒度控制的简易起点。如果产品肯花时间预判人们多样化的需求、能力与背景，我们就能更好地找到针对这些需求进行调整的方式。透明的控件，有赖于透彻说明一项功能如何运作，包括数据如何被收集和使用。</p>\n<h2>构建情境感知的体验</h2>\n<p>在 Google 委托开展的另一项 2019 年研究中，数字健康团队了解到，科技在妨碍或支持人们目标时，对人影响最大。不出所料，当目标被科技妨碍时，人们并不觉得好受。事实上，他们感到烦躁、疲惫，甚至羞愧。反过来，当人们感到目标得到科技支持时，他们会感到快乐、自豪、平静和兴奋。理解并支持个人的目标是<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/digital-wellbeing-design-systems\">根本所在</a>，而这可以通过思考自适应性来实现。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>每个人的情境，就像他们的目标、能力和背景一样千差万别。再把一天中的时间、所使用的设备和所在位置考虑进来，你就能看出适应性对健康有多么重要。早晨行之有效的产品体验，未必能满足人们晚间的需求。要考虑所有这些变量，以及它们可能如何层层累积、让人不胜其烦，然后构建尽可能自适应的体验，来管理这些累积效应。</p>\n<h2>超越原则</h2>\n<p>为数字健康而构建，不只是勾选一份原则清单——它还需要同理心和创造力。当你把这些 UX 特质与数字健康原则相结合，设计就能支持人们的目标，并最终放大积极的成果。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":false,"caption":"Illustration by Jack Cunningham","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/8d1ed41c9f88a4b12a82656e4da77cfd191b62d4c55721a5afeff147aa6420baec3379bbbd0445cf2d4cf408c3965ca1ac30163297c39b7417c7152c3ee2b3ca","height":698,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/_bhfdZLDKur8EE9965WvrU3b3LeB8I2IQz3cwz3sHaIdp5T6SQtXWCzzOeC_OLzHVOzWitgpz6Z_nYQQBPo97K_x2g8G6-U97GdNBw","width":1058}},{"a11y_description":"Mobile screen showing a circular chart of time spent on various apps, such as Facebook, Netflix, and Youtube","bordered":true,"caption":"To encourage intentional phone use, Android’s Digital Wellbeing dashboard provides usage data with a visualization.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/ffb617a4c2a7f436cfcbdb0c2d259e242e9263eeb69260e541b85cae13fc8134a70ebc62dd57d50fd26c51595f45e834221a15e6d95c26b3bb76c320d10025fe","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WpVuTuHT50MfM0gpCpE0DnTwy1d7-1xZATtk4Xld6v1TdLhKVf4OBnEK1nsCjde16arRtsORvogODiabHJdZfDx28Wu65zY1faTASg","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"Mobile screen shows an avatar of a child and data about the child’s device use, including location, recently used apps, and daily device use limit","bordered":true,"caption":"To provide transparency and control, Family Link gives parents access to their kids’ activity and schedules.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/9cbacb0878a1c7813435158d25bfb4811b6670c4c8316caccd5dd6b25f4cb3b8e66b801fa6346a52b12e811a6f7a264f2e800f4d788a0ae0b6f84fbd359597fa","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/vsA5BuUBe2ssAXfSjvu83JPxHE4K9-CIfwakGk-MWiyXEmhqxO_opi0UEGid83uAyqsRGtult62ZmR507Y5qxA0pi8o3VnqBVPmnC08","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"A mobile settings screen shows a clock and day of the week selections under the header bedtime mode","bordered":true,"caption":"To adapt for the need for sleep, Bedtime mode uses the clock to set a preferred schedule, which also enables features like Grayscale and Do Not Disturb.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/f0232af8e00ae6365fcdd8fd7cd180233ba382fe8429d934d68ea359ae0c78e77ee8e9ff724ae60a2c6768faa1eb793920db3ef6a239804a30f1ad727fd7fd33","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VVBjOzGBIn5cvkVf-wfKG16Y3eEdg1y-swiyRzNCPU8YPLaVLSLga8M1s2nZTnmeqASlK_duzrGaGkxdDWND5JiAEyGOkgscCzjcTw","width":1064}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2020","hero":{"a11y_description":"Illustration of a person stretching in a yoga pose, with their reflection appearing below on a large phone screen","bordered":true,"caption":"Illustration by Jack Cunningham","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/3ab9e74375358d818a356fef0e190e2c248ee8f16cadd49a71d4b18822722d50ff58ee1366191e7c29c1ae87cd62e13e36fdbebaf60a89a484823cf3947cfd76","height":1955,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7A-P57HPrjeG232q8o78u721pWBzCChFmGjJ4MA26UM9Qy5sF6oqtzH2ajQN7ST8cSA6T32e6AtZC3AoDm_6SUXT8yhYi1F7zUIA","width":3181}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"Digital-wellbeing, UX","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"运用 UX 设计，通过默认设置赋能用户、唤起对行为的觉察等","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/3fdc2c0ae5fde7703dd3b9a3f40a43f8c76fa7fb34378d84efb94973e2b8d062deecbb1db9d54bb039cef645c02c214c3745a9008a44d8c83a03b8361e66